From 64fac81df42f4a2db44e6885b294249ff458042f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: CaeliGlow <caeliglow@mockifylab.local>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 09:46:39 +0500
Subject: [PATCH 6/7] caeliglow: right-edge power pill, on-by-default edges,
 AnimatedImage

Adds a new caeliglow_power shell action opening a center-right animated session pill (Logout, Power, animated logo, Lock, Restart) with native confirm countdowns. Adds AnimatedImage, a reusable idle-to-hover GIF driver shared by the pill and the launcher avatar. Registers the pill panel and dispatches the action. Flips hot-corners defaults to enabled with bottom-edge=launcher and right-edge=caeliglow_power so the signature interactions show with no config; other corners stay inert. The original power action (native SessionPanel) is preserved.
